2026-07-29T06:48:06.7275640Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-29T06:48:06.7276170Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-29T06:48:06.7276870Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-29T06:48:06.7277760Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
